<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Royal Dutch.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Royal Dutch.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International said it has issued 500,000 American-style call warrants on shares of Royal Dutch Petroleum Company.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    430 DFL		   PREMIUM	13.77 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     25.1 DFL		  GEARING	15.93 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   12.JUN.98		 PAY DATE	27.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  400 DFL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
